re ended, fossil fuel subsidies are removed, fossil fuel subsidies phase-out, fossil fuel subsidies should be eliminated, fossil fuel subsidies will be eliminated, fossil fuel subsidies will be removed, fossil fuel subsidy are eliminated, fossil fuel subsidy are ended, fossil fuel subsidy are removed, fossil fuel subsidy should be eliminated, fossil fuel subsidy will be eliminated, fossil fuel subsidy will be removed, phase-out all fossil fuel subsidies, phase-out all fossil fuel subsidy, phase-out any fossil fuel subsidies, phase-out any fossil fuel subsidy, phase-out fossil fuel subsidies, phase-out fossil fuel subsidy, phase-out the fossil fuel subsidies, phase-out the fossil fuel subsidy, phases out all fossil fuel subsidies, phases out all fossil fuel subsidy, phases out any fossil fuel subsidies, phases out any fossil fuel subsidy, phases out fossil fuel subsidies, phases out fossil fuel subsidy, phases out the fossil fuel subsidies, phases out the fossil fuel subsidy, phasing out all fossil fuel subsidies, phasing out all fossil fuel subsidy, phasing out any fossil fuel subsidies, phasing out any fossil fuel subsidy, phasing out the fossil fuel subsidies, phasing out the fossil fuel subsidy, reform all fossil fuel subsidies, reform all fossil fuel subsidy, reform any fossil fuel subsidies, reform any fossil fuel subsidy, reform the fossil fuel subsidies, reform the fossil fuel subsidy, reforming all fossil fuel subsidies, reforming all fossil fuel subsidy, reforming any fossil fuel subsidies, reforming any fossil fuel subsidy, reforming fossil fuel subsidies, reforming fossil fuel subsidy, reforming the fossil fuel subsidies, reforming the fossil fuel subsidy, reforms all fossil fuel subsidies, reforms all fossil fuel subsidy, reforms any fossil fuel subsidies, reforms any fossil fuel subsidy, reforms fossil fuel subsidies, reforms fossil fuel subsidy, reforms the fossil fuel subsidies, reforms the fossil fuel subsidy, remove all fossil fuel subsidies, remove all fossil fuel subsidy, remove any fossil fuel subsidies, remove any fossil fuel subsidy, remove fossil fuel subsidies, remove fossil fuel subsidy, remove the fossil fuel subsidies, remove the fossil fuel subsidy, removes all fossil fuel subsidies, removes all fossil fuel subsidy, removes any fossil fuel subsidies, removes any fossil fuel subsidy, removes fossil fuel subsidies, removes fossil fuel subsidy, removes the fossil fuel subsidies, removes the fossil fuel subsidy, removing all fossil fuel subsidies, removing all fossil fuel subsidy, removing any fossil fuel subsidies, removing any fossil fuel subsidy, removing fossil fuel subsidy, removing the fossil fuel subsidies, removing the fossil fuel subsidy, the fossil fuel subsidies are eliminated, the fossil fuel subsidies are ended, the fossil fuel subsidies are removed, the fossil fuel subsidies phase-out, the fossil fuel subsidies should be eliminated, the fossil fuel subsidies will be eliminated, the fossil fuel subsidies will be removed, the fossil fuel subsidy are eliminated, the fossil fuel subsidy are ended, the fossil fuel subsidy are removed, the fossil fuel subsidy phase-out, the fossil fuel subsidy should be eliminated, the fossil fuel subsidy will be eliminated, the fossil fuel subsidy will be removed</skos:altLabel>
        <cpr:P2 rdf:resource="https://climatepolicyradar.wikibase.cloud/entity/Q1275"/>
        <cpr:P7 xml:lang="en">The removal of fossil-fuel subsidies can be by removing the production subsidies, which are tax breaks or direct payments that reduce the cost of producing coal, oil or gas or removing consumption subsidies, which cut fuel prices for the end user, such as by fixing the price at the petrol pump so that it is less than the market rate.</cpr:P7>
        <schema:description xml:lang="en">The removal of a subsidy to fossil fuel companies.</schema:description>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


