        <cpr:P3 rdf:resource="https://climatepolicyradar.wikibase.cloud/entity/Q775"/>
        <cpr:P7 xml:lang="en">Public funding for climate policy is the use of public funds to support climate initiatives and integrate climate into other projects. Examples are investing in climate-smart infrastructure, technologies, and social welfare.</cpr:P7>
        <schema:description xml:lang="en">Public funding for climate policy is the use of public funds to support climate initiatives and integrate climate into other projects. Examples are investing in climate-smart infrastructure, technologies, and social welfare.</schema:description>
